WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.062 --> 00:00:08.260
Wearing a gold robe over his clothing, Tom sat on the throne in the cathedral.

2
00:00:08.261 --> 00:00:13.727
He grew more miserable with every minute of the coronation ceremony.

3
00:00:13.728 --> 00:00:17.160
At last the great moment arrived.

4
00:00:17.161 --> 00:00:22.164
The archbishop lifted the crown and held it over Tom's head.

5
00:00:22.165 --> 00:00:29.696
Everyone was so busy watching the ceremony that no one noticed a boy in rags.

6
00:00:29.697 --> 00:00:35.231
He stepped from behind an old tomb and walked up the aisle.

7
00:00:35.232 --> 00:00:37.867
"Stop!" Edward shouted.

8
00:00:37.868 --> 00:00:43.735
"I forbid you to crown him! I am the king!"

9
00:00:43.736 --> 00:00:47.734
Tom stood up as a guard grabbed Edward's arm.

10
00:00:47.735 --> 00:00:50.862
"Let go of him!" Tom commanded.

11
00:00:50.863 --> 00:00:57.574
"He's telling the truth! He is the king!"

12
00:00:57.575 --> 00:01:02.479
Lord Hertford was as startled as everyone else but quickly recovered.

13
00:01:02.480 --> 00:01:06.218
"Unfortunately, His Majesty is ill again.

14
00:01:06.219 --> 00:01:11.056
Pay no attention to him and throw that pauper out."

15
00:01:11.057 --> 00:01:15.993
"Touch him again, and you'll be thrown out!" Tom said to the guard.

16
00:01:15.994 --> 00:01:21.071
The guard let go of Edward, who continued walking up the aisle.

17
00:01:21.072 --> 00:01:25.295
As Edward reached the throne, Tom fell on his knees.

18
00:01:25.296 --> 00:01:31.141
"Let Tom Canty be the first to swear allegiance to you, my king."

19
00:01:31.142 --> 00:01:34.629
Lord Hertford could not contain his surprise.

20
00:01:34.630 --> 00:01:38.185
"You two look exactly alike!

21
00:01:38.186 --> 00:01:45.760
If you don't mind, sir," he said to Edward, "I'd like to ask you some questions."

22
00:01:45.761 --> 00:01:48.949
"Certainly," Edward replied.

23
00:01:48.950 --> 00:01:56.234
Lord Hertford quizzed Edward about the court, the palace, King Henry, and Princess Elizabeth.

24
00:01:56.235 --> 00:02:00.612
Edward was able to answer everything correctly.

25
00:02:00.613 --> 00:02:03.826
"Impressive!" Lord Hertford said.

26
00:02:03.827 --> 00:02:09.208
"But someone could have helped you learn the right answers."

27
00:02:09.209 --> 00:02:14.275
Tom remembered how Marlow had helped him do just that.

28
00:02:14.276 --> 00:02:19.213
"I'm not convinced that you're Edward," Lord Hertford said.

29
00:02:19.214 --> 00:02:22.657
"If only there was another way to test you . . . Wait!

30
00:02:22.658 --> 00:02:27.048
I've got it! Where is the Great Seal?

31
00:02:27.049 --> 00:02:30.952
Only the real King Edward knows this."

32
00:02:30.953 --> 00:02:36.384
"I have no idea where it is," Tom said, trying to be helpful.

33
00:02:36.385 --> 00:02:40.810
"Oh, that's easy! Where's my whipping boy?"

34
00:02:40.811 --> 00:02:47.767
Edward looked around until he spotted Marlow.

35
00:02:47.768 --> 00:02:50.449
"Take a carriage to the palace.

36
00:02:50.450 --> 00:02:54.758
You'll find the seal in a hidden compartment in my room.

37
00:02:54.759 --> 00:02:58.583
A servant will open the compartment for you."

38
00:02:58.584 --> 00:03:03.765
Marlow hesitated to obey this boy who was dressed worse than he was.

39
00:03:03.766 --> 00:03:06.861
"What are you waiting for?" Tom said.

40
00:03:06.862 --> 00:03:09.601
"You heard King Edward."

41
00:03:09.602 --> 00:03:13.298
Marlow ran down the aisle.

42
00:03:13.299 --> 00:03:18.432
The cathedral buzzed with chatter as everyone waited for Marlow's return.

43
00:03:18.433 --> 00:03:23.197
"I think the pauper is the real king," one man said to another.

44
00:03:23.198 --> 00:03:26.229
"He picked Marlow out of the crowd."

45
00:03:26.230 --> 00:03:34.235
"Yes, but he didn't know that Marlow is no longer a whipping boy," the second man said.

46
00:03:34.236 --> 00:03:38.569
At last Marlow returned—with empty hands.

47
00:03:38.570 --> 00:03:40.837
Lord Hertford shook his head.

48
00:03:40.838 --> 00:03:46.753
"I don't understand how anyone could lose something as big as the Great Seal.

49
00:03:46.754 --> 00:03:50.279
It's a heavy disk, made of gold—"

50
00:03:50.280 --> 00:03:52.614
"Wait!" Tom shouted.

51
00:03:52.615 --> 00:03:56.148
"Are you talking about a round thing with lettering on it?"

52
00:03:56.149 --> 00:03:59.305
Both Lord Hertford and Edward nodded.

53
00:03:59.306 --> 00:04:06.050
"If only you'd described it like that, you could have had it awhile ago," Tom said to Lord Hertford.

54
00:04:06.051 --> 00:04:12.059
Then he turned to Edward. "The day we met, you hid it before you left.

55
00:04:12.060 --> 00:04:16.171
Tell everyone here where you put it."

56
00:04:16.172 --> 00:04:21.200
Edward thought and thought while Tom grew increasingly nervous.

57
00:04:21.201 --> 00:04:28.286
"Remember," Tom said, "we talked about our families and what I did with my friends.

58
00:04:28.287 --> 00:04:31.980
We traded clothes and looked in the mirror."

59
00:04:31.981 --> 00:04:35.961
With every hint, Edward nodded in agreement.

60
00:04:35.962 --> 00:04:43.376
"And then you noticed that the guard had injured my hand." Tom held it up.

61
00:04:43.377 --> 00:04:47.126
"Look, you can still see a faint bruise.

62
00:04:47.127 --> 00:04:51.245
You wanted to scold the guard, but first—"

63
00:04:51.246 --> 00:04:54.863
"Oh, now I remember!" Edward cried.

64
00:04:54.864 --> 00:05:00.007
"Marlow, go to my room and look inside an armored glove on the table."

65
00:05:00.008 --> 00:05:07.894
"Yes!" Tom hugged Edward. "That's it."

66
00:05:07.895 --> 00:05:12.328
When Marlow returned with the Great Seal, Tom grinned.

67
00:05:12.329 --> 00:05:17.558
"And now, my king, it's time for you to be crowned."

68
00:05:17.559 --> 00:05:22.148
Everyone in the cathedral applauded.

69
00:05:22.149 --> 00:05:27.052
Lord Hertford waited for the noise to die down before addressing Tom.

70
00:05:27.053 --> 00:05:34.080
"And you—whoever you are—will be sent to prison for impersonating the king!"

71
00:05:34.081 --> 00:05:39.470
"No!" Edward cried. "I owe my crown to Tom.

72
00:05:39.471 --> 00:05:43.000
He could have said nothing and continued as king.

73
00:05:43.001 --> 00:05:47.011
Instead he helped me remember where the Great Seal was.

74
00:05:47.012 --> 00:05:51.349
Sit down, Lord Hertford."

75
00:05:51.350 --> 00:05:54.657
Lord Hertford sank into a seat.

76
00:05:54.658 --> 00:05:58.658
"And one more thing," Edward said to everyone.

77
00:05:58.659 --> 00:06:03.189
"I've heard wonderful reports of Tom's brief reign.

78
00:06:03.190 --> 00:06:08.866
I can only hope to be as good a king as he has been."

79
00:06:08.867 --> 00:06:13.435
Tom removed the gold robe and placed it over Edward's shoulders.

80
00:06:13.436 --> 00:06:19.817
"By the way," Edward whispered, "how did you know where the Great Seal was?"

81
00:06:19.818 --> 00:06:25.074
Tom turned red and confessed. "I was using it to crack nuts!"

82
00:06:25.075 --> 00:06:32.558
The boys laughed together.

83
00:06:32.559 --> 00:06:40.652
Then the coronation ceremony resumed, and Edward was crowned king.

